# Copy to `.env.local` (gitignored) to point a fork at its own GA4 property.
#
# Leaving this empty disables analytics entirely , the app treats a missing or
# malformed ID as "off" rather than erroring.
#
# Two things gate analytics on, both of which must pass (see src/core/analytics.ts):
#   1. a well-formed G-XXXXXXXXXX id, and
#   2. a hostname listed in PROD_HOSTS.
# A fork therefore needs to add its own hostname to PROD_HOSTS as well , that is
# deliberate, so a fork can never report into the upstream property by accident.
VITE_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=
